<title>USA: U.S. aluminum stocks flat for April - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. aluminum stocks flat for April - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total U.S. aluminum stocks held by integrated and non-integrated producers and smelters including scrap, ingot, metal in-process and finished products totaled 1,997,000 short tons in April, unchanged from the revised total of 1,997,000 short tons in March, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Primary Production fell to 325,000 short tons in April compared with 338,000 short tons for March.</p>
<p>Net shipments were 862,000 short tons in April versus 852,000 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
